 coaches automation page",[269],{"_252":164,"_260":267},45,"See where slow replies, weak qualification, and booking friction are costing you clients, and what a practical automation setup could change.",[274],"p.section-subtitle",{"_252":164,"_260":275}," See where slow replies, weak qualification, and booking friction are costing you clients, and what a practical automation setup could change. ",44,"level","Ready to Improve Your DM-to-Client Flow?","h2.section-title","section","brand-gradient","animate","section.section.bg-circuit.animate",[280,618,282,619,620],{"_277":228,"_164":617},[287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325],{"_252":243,"_162":220,"_277":228,"_164":617,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":218,"_164":613,"_256":614,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":214,"_164":606,"_256":607,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":210,"_164":602,"_256":603,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":208,"_277":228,"_164":601,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":204,"_164":597,"_256":598,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":202,"_164":593,"_256":594,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":198,"_328":37,"_329":580,"_238":331},{"_252":253,"_162":196,"_164":570,"_256":571,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":193,"_164":563,"_256":564,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":190,"_277":228,"_164":562,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":187,"_164":558,"_256":559,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":184,"_164":554,"_256":555,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":181,"_328":170,"_329":541,"_238":408},{"_252":253,"_162":178,"_164":534,"_256":535,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":175,"_164":527,"_256":528,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":172,"_277":228,"_164":526,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":163,"_164":522,"_256":523,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":517,"_164":518,"_256":519,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":493,"_328":170,"_329":494,"_238":408},{"_252":253,"_162":488,"_164":489,"_256":490,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":477,"_164":478,"_256":479,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":475,"_277":228,"_164":476,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":470,"_164":471,"_256":472,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":462,"_164":463,"_256":464,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":440,"_328":170,"_329":441,"_238":408},{"_252":253,"_162":432,"_164":433,"_256":434,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":430,"_277":228,"_164":431,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":425,"_164":426,"_256":427,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":406,"_328":170,"_329":407,"_238":408},{"_252":253,"_162":401,"_164":402,"_256":403,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":393,"_164":394,"_256":395,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":391,"_277":228,"_164":392,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":386,"_164":387,"_256":388,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":378,"_164":379,"_256":380,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":373,"_164":374,"_256":375,"_238":367},{"_252":253,"_162":364,"_164":365,"_256":366,"_238":367},{"_252":243,"_162":361,"_277":228,"_164":362,"_238":363},{"_252":326,"_162":327,"_328":37,"_329":330,"_238":331},"list",43,"ordered","items",[332,333,334,335,336,337,338,339,340],"ol",{"_164":194,"_256":359},{"_164":191,"_256":357},{"_164":188,"_256":355},{"_164":185,"_256":353},{"_164":182,"_256":351},{"_164":179,"_256":349},{"_164":176,"_256":347},{"_164":173,"_256":345},{"_164":165,"_256":341},[342],{"_252":343,"_164":165,"_344":167,"_166":167,"_169":170,"_171":37},"link","href",[346],{"_252":343,"_164":173,"_344":174,"_166":174,"_169":170,"_171":37},[348],{"_252":343,"_164":176,"_344":177,"_166":177,"_169":37,"_171":37},[350],{"_252":343,"_164":179,"_344":180,"_166":180,"_169":37,"_171":37},[352],{"_252":343,"_164":182,"_344":183,"_166":183,"_169":37,"_171":37},[354],{"_252":343,"_164":185,"_344":186,"_166":186,"_169":37,"_171":37},[356],{"_252":343,"_164":188,"_344":189,"_166":189,"_169":37,"_171":37},[358],{"_252":343,"_164":191,"_344":192,"_166":192,"_169":37,"_171":37},[360],{"_252":343,"_164":194,"_344":195,"_166":195,"_169":37,"_171":37},42,"References","h2",41,"For fitness coaches and online coaches looking to see what AI-powered lead capture and client follow-up looks like in practice, the Silverstone AI fitness coaches page sets out the specific workflows we build for this industry.",[368,369,370],"p",{"_252":164,"_260":372},{"_252":343,"_164":197,"_344":174,"_166":174,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":371}," sets out the specific workflows we build for this industry. "," For fitness coaches and online coaches looking to see what AI-powered lead capture and client follow-up looks like in practice, the ",40,"The strongest systems stay narrow at first: capture, qualify, convert. Once that works, you can add reminders, reporting, reactivation, or segmented follow-up. For coaches who want outside help mapping the workflow, comparing tools, or connecting it to existing services, a single review call can often clarify the next step far faster than weeks of trial and error.",[376],{"_252":164,"_260":377}," The strongest systems stay narrow at first: capture, qualify, convert. Once that works, you can add reminders, reporting, reactivation, or segmented follow-up. For coaches who want outside help mapping the workflow, comparing tools, or connecting it to existing services, a single review call can often clarify the next step far faster than weeks of trial and error. ",39,"That makes this one of the more accessible automation projects for a coach or creator. It does not require a full website rebuild, a custom app, or a large operations team. It simply improves the handoff between attention and action. If you are also reviewing site-side conversion paths, our overview of AI website tools for UK small businesses is a useful companion piece because the same principle applies on landing pages and enquiry forms as it does in DMs.",[381,382,383],{"_252":164,"_260":385},{"_252":343,"_164":199,"_344":201,"_166":200,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":384}," is a useful companion piece because the same principle applies on landing pages and enquiry forms as it does in DMs. "," That makes this one of the more accessible automation projects for a coach or creator. It does not require a full website rebuild, a custom app, or a large operations team. It simply improves the handoff between attention and action. If you are also reviewing site-side conversion paths, our overview of ",38,"The practical path is usually straightforward. Start with Instagram quick replies if you need a same-day fix. Add ManyChat when you want branching qualification. Connect it to scheduling or payment tools through Zapier when the volume justifies it. Log answers in a sheet or CRM so you can see what kind of leads your content is actually generating.",[389],{"_252":164,"_260":390}," The practical path is usually straightforward. Start with Instagram quick replies if you need a same-day fix. Add ManyChat when you want branching qualification. Connect it to scheduling or payment tools through Zapier when the volume justifies it. Log answers in a sheet or CRM so you can see what kind of leads your content is actually generating. ",37,"Putting the system together without overcomplicating it",36,"Human escalation should happen whenever the lead is unusually valuable, unusually complex, or unusually unclear. Someone with a premium budget, a complicated health context, or a highly specific goal should not be sent through a rigid automated path for too long. This is one reason broader SME surveys, including the January 2026 findings reported by QuickBooks UK, tend to show the strongest gains where AI saves time on routine communication rather than replacing judgment-heavy conversations.",[396,397,398],{"_252":164,"_260":400},{"_252":343,"_164":203,"_344":180,"_166":180,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":399},", tend to show the strongest gains where AI saves time on routine communication rather than replacing judgment-heavy conversations. "," Human escalation should happen whenever the lead is unusually valuable, unusually complex, or unusually unclear. Someone with a premium budget, a complicated health context, or a highly specific goal should not be sent through a rigid automated path for too long. This is one reason broader SME surveys, including the January 2026 findings reported by ",35,"These metrics are more useful than vanity counts like follower growth because they connect directly to commercial performance. They also show where the friction sits. If people ignore the first message, rewrite it. If qualified leads are not booking, simplify the booking page or reduce scheduling delay. If booked calls are not showing, tighten reminders and confirmation language.",[404],{"_252":164,"_260":405}," These metrics are more useful than vanity counts like follower growth because they connect directly to commercial performance. They also show where the friction sits. If people ignore the first message, rewrite it. If qualified leads are not booking, simplify the booking page or reduce scheduling delay. If booked calls are not showing, tighten reminders and confirmation language. ",34,[409,410,411,412],"ul",{"_164":422,"_256":423},{"_164":419,"_256":420},{"_164":416,"_256":417},{"_164":413,"_256":414},"Booked-to-showed rate: are reminders reducing drop-off before the call?",[415],{"_252":164,"_260":413},"Qualified-to-booked rate: is the booking handoff smooth enough?",[418],{"_252":164,"_260":416},"Reply-to-qualified rate: are your questions identifying realistic prospects?",[421],{"_252":164,"_260":419},"DM-to-reply rate: are people engaging with your first auto-response?",[424],{"_252":164,"_260":422},33,"Automation only becomes useful when it is measurable. Four numbers are enough for most coaching businesses at the start:",[428],{"_252":164,"_260":429}," Automation only becomes useful when it is measurable. Four numbers are enough for most coaching businesses at the start: ",32,"What to measure and when a human should take over",31,"Tone matters too. A message can be automated without sounding robotic. Use the same language patterns you use in captions and voice notes. Short sentences, contractions, and clear next steps tend to feel more natural than over-produced scripts. For a broader compliance overview, see our article on AI automation and UK GDPR for SMEs.",[435,436,437],{"_252":164,"_260":439},{"_252":343,"_164":205,"_344":207,"_166":206,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":438},". "," Tone matters too. A message can be automated without sounding robotic. Use the same language patterns you use in captions and voice notes. Short sentences, contractions, and clear next steps tend to feel more natural than over-produced scripts. For a broader compliance overview, see our article on ",30,[442,443,444,445,446],{"_164":459,"_256":460},{"_164":456,"_256":457},{"_164":453,"_256":454},{"_164":450,"_256":451},{"_164":447,"_256":448},"Review your privacy policy so it reflects DM-based collection and connected tools.",[449],{"_252":164,"_260":447},"Set a sensible retention window for unconverted leads rather than keeping DM data indefinitely.",[452],{"_252":164,"_260":450},"Give people an easy way to stop follow-up messages.",[455],{"_252":164,"_260":453},"State briefly if you will store their answers so future messages or a discovery call are more useful.",[458],{"_252":164,"_260":456},"Make it clear who is replying and that automation may be involved in the first response.",[461],{"_252":164,"_260":459},29,"The UK Information Commissioner's Office explains the relevant standards in its guidance on direct marketing. Practical steps for coaches include:",[465,466,467],{"_252":164,"_260":469},{"_252":343,"_164":209,"_344":177,"_166":177,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":468},". Practical steps for coaches include: "," The UK Information Commissioner's Office explains the relevant standards in its guidance on ",28,"Any Instagram automation UK setup has to respect data protection and direct marketing rules. In most coaching cases, the lawful basis for the initial exchange will be legitimate interests because the person contacted you first. But the moment you store information, trigger follow-up sequences, or reuse the data for broader marketing, you should be much more deliberate.",[473],{"_252":164,"_260":474}," Any Instagram automation UK setup has to respect data protection and direct marketing rules. In most coaching cases, the lawful basis for the initial exchange will be legitimate interests because the person contacted you first. But the moment you store information, trigger follow-up sequences, or reuse the data for broader marketing, you should be much more deliberate. ",27,"Keep it legal: GDPR, marketing rules, and a human tone",26,"If you are comparing this type of workflow with other front-desk systems, it is worth reading our guide to AI voice agents for UK SMEs and our breakdown of AI receptionist costs and ROI. The delivery channel differs, but the commercial logic is the same: capture intent early, reduce admin friction, and move people into a clear next step.",[480,481,482,483,484],{"_252":164,"_260":487},{"_252":343,"_164":215,"_344":217,"_166":216,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":486},{"_252":343,"_164":211,"_344":213,"_166":212,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":485},". The delivery channel differs, but the commercial logic is the same: capture intent early, reduce admin friction, and move people into a clear next step. "," and "," If you are comparing this type of workflow with other front-desk systems, it is worth reading ",25,"For higher-value prospects, you can add a rule that sends you an email or Slack alert so you can layer a personal message on top of the automated flow. That blended model is often stronger than either extreme. Fully manual systems are slow, while fully automated ones can feel impersonal when the lead is complex, premium, or uncertain.",[491],{"_252":164,"_260":492}," For higher-value prospects, you can add a rule that sends you an email or Slack alert so you can layer a personal message on top of the automated flow. That blended model is often stronger than either extreme. Fully manual systems are slow, while fully automated ones can feel impersonal when the lead is complex, premium, or uncertain. ",24,[495,496,497,498,499],{"_164":514,"_256":515},{"_164":511,"_256":512},{"_164":506,"_256":507},{"_164":503,"_256":504},{"_164":500,"_256":501},"Stripe can collect a deposit or payment where your offer structure allows it.",[502],{"_252":164,"_260":500},"Calendly or Acuity handles available slots.",[505],{"_252":164,"_260":503},"Zapier passes the lead into your booking, payment, or reporting tools.",[508,509],{"_252":343,"_164":219,"_344":186,"_166":186,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":510}," passes the lead into your booking, payment, or reporting tools.","ManyChat runs the qualifier and applies tags.",[513],{"_252":164,"_260":511},"Instagram DM starts the conversation.",[516],{"_252":164,"_260":514},23,"A common stack looks like this:",[520],{"_252":164,"_260":521}," A common stack looks like this: ","The third step is where fitness coach client conversion usually improves fastest. Once someone has shown fit and intent, do not make them wait for another round of scheduling messages. Send them directly to the next commercial action: a booking page, a deposit request, or a checkout flow for a lower-ticket offer.",[524],{"_252":164,"_260":525}," The third step is where fitness coach client conversion usually improves fastest. Once someone has shown fit and intent, do not make them wait for another round of scheduling messages. Send them directly to the next commercial action: a booking page, a deposit request, or a checkout flow for a lower-ticket offer. ","Step 3: Move qualified leads straight to booking or payment","For coaches, that means the system should sort and prepare the conversation, not impersonate a closer. The best result of Step 2 is not a robotic exchange; it is a cleaner, more focused handoff to you with the relevant context already captured. If you work in creator-led or hybrid online coaching, the service logic is similar to what we discuss on the Fitness Influencers & Online Coaches page: reduce manual back-and-forth, then reserve human attention for the highest-value conversations.",[529,530,531],{"_252":164,"_260":533},{"_252":343,"_164":221,"_344":174,"_166":174,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":532}," page: reduce manual back-and-forth, then reserve human attention for the highest-value conversations. "," For coaches, that means the system should sort and prepare the conversation, not impersonate a closer. The best result of Step 2 is not a robotic exchange; it is a cleaner, more focused handoff to you with the relevant context already captured. If you work in creator-led or hybrid online coaching, the service logic is similar to what we discuss on the ","In ManyChat or a similar tool, answers can be tagged automatically so serious prospects move into the next step while lower-intent enquiries are kept in a lighter nurture path. This is a practical example of human-in-the-loop automation rather than full substitution. That principle is reinforced by the 2026 automation benchmark covered by Enterprise Times, which highlighted clear KPIs, phased rollout, and sensible human oversight as common success factors.",[536,537,538],{"_252":164,"_260":540},{"_252":343,"_164":223,"_344":183,"_166":183,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":539},", which highlighted clear KPIs, phased rollout, and sensible human oversight as common success factors. "," In ManyChat or a similar tool, answers can be tagged automatically so serious prospects move into the next step while lower-intent enquiries are kept in a lighter nurture path. This is a practical example of human-in-the-loop automation rather than full substitution. That principle is reinforced by the 2026 automation benchmark covered by ",[542,543,544],{"_164":551,"_256":552},{"_164":548,"_256":549},{"_164":545,"_256":546},"When are you looking to start? This separates active buyers from casual browsers.",[547],{"_252":164,"_260":545},"Have you worked with a coach before, and what budget range are you considering? This surfaces intent and commercial fit.",[550],{"_252":164,"_260":548},"What is your main goal right now? This tells you whether the prospect is aligned with what you actually deliver.",[553],{"_252":164,"_260":551},"Three questions are usually enough:",[556],{"_252":164,"_260":557}," Three questions are usually enough: ","Once the lead has replied, the second step is qualification. This is where many inbox-heavy businesses lose hours each week, because every conversation becomes bespoke too early. A short qualification sequence protects your time and improves the quality of calls that do get booked.",[560],{"_252":164,"_260":561}," Once the lead has replied, the second step is qualification. This is where many inbox-heavy businesses lose hours each week, because every conversation becomes bespoke too early. A short qualification sequence protects your time and improves the quality of calls that do get booked. ","Step 2: Qualify with two or three questions, not a full sales call","The aim at this stage is not persuasion. It is continuity. You are preserving attention long enough to decide whether the conversation deserves more time. Coaches exploring broader operational improvements often run into the same pattern described in common AI automation failures for UK SMEs: they try to automate everything before defining the job. In DM workflows, the first job is simply to stop warm leads going cold.",[565,566,567],{"_252":164,"_260":569},{"_252":343,"_164":225,"_344":227,"_166":226,"_169":170,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":568},": they try to automate everything before defining the job. In DM workflows, the first job is simply to stop warm leads going cold. "," The aim at this stage is not persuasion. It is continuity. You are preserving attention long enough to decide whether the conversation deserves more time. Coaches exploring broader operational improvements often run into the same pattern described in ","Instagram offers native messaging tools and quick replies through Meta's business messaging features, which may be enough for a basic setup. If you want branching logic based on how someone answers, tools such as ManyChat make the flow easier to manage without code.",[572,573,574,575,576],{"_252":164,"_260":579},{"_252":343,"_164":231,"_344":192,"_166":192,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":578},{"_252":343,"_164":229,"_344":189,"_166":189,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":577}," make the flow easier to manage without code. ",", which may be enough for a basic setup. If you want branching logic based on how someone answers, tools such as "," Instagram offers native messaging tools and quick replies through ",[581,582,583],{"_164":590,"_256":591},{"_164":587,"_256":588},{"_164":584,"_256":585},"Asks one simple qualification question, such as whether they want one-to-one coaching, a group offer, or something else.",[586],{"_252":164,"_260":584},"Explains what happens next and when you will reply personally if needed.",[589],{"_252":164,"_260":587},"Confirms that their message has been received.",[592],{"_252":164,"_260":590},"A strong first reply usually does three things in under a minute of reading time:",[595],{"_252":164,"_260":596}," A strong first reply usually does three things in under a minute of reading time: ","The first step in good DM automation for coaches is not a complex chatbot. It is a short message that confirms receipt, sets expectations, and asks one useful question. Done well, this removes the awkward silence that makes prospects assume their message has been missed.",[599],{"_252":164,"_260":600}," The first step in good DM automation for coaches is not a complex chatbot. It is a short message that confirms receipt, sets expectations, and asks one useful question. Done well, this removes the awkward silence that makes prospects assume their message has been missed. ","Step 1: Capture the lead with an immediate, useful auto-reply","That is why the goal is not to replace your sales conversation. It is to hold the lead in place until you can have one. If your programme is worth £200 per month and two warm prospects each week disappear because they sit in your inbox too long, the cost of delay is easy to underestimate. Recovering even one extra client a week can materially change monthly revenue, which is why learning how to convert Instagram DMs to clients is more than a marketing tactic; it is an operational fix.",[604],{"_252":164,"_260":605}," That is why the goal is not to replace your sales conversation. It is to hold the lead in place until you can have one. If your programme is worth £200 per month and two warm prospects each week disappear because they sit in your inbox too long, the cost of delay is easy to underestimate. Recovering even one extra client a week can materially change monthly revenue, which is why learning how to convert Instagram DMs to clients is more than a marketing tactic; it is an operational fix. ","The weakness is usually operational. DMs arrive while you are training clients, filming content, travelling, or simply offline. By the time you reply, the prospect may have lost momentum or chosen someone else who responded first. Research discussed by Harvard Business Review remains useful here: the odds of qualifying an inbound lead drop sharply as response time increases. The core point is simple even if the exact context is broader than coaching: fast replies win more conversations.",[608,609,610],{"_252":164,"_260":612},{"_252":343,"_164":233,"_344":195,"_166":195,"_169":37,"_171":37},{"_252":164,"_260":611}," remains useful here: the odds of qualifying an inbound lead drop sharply as response time increases. The core point is simple even if the exact context is broader than coaching: fast replies win more conversations. "," The weakness is usually operational. DMs arrive while you are training clients, filming content, travelling, or simply offline. By the time you reply, the prospect may have lost momentum or chosen someone else who responded first. Research discussed by ","For many UK fitness coaches, Instagram is the top-of-funnel channel that already works. A prospect watches a Reel, clicks through to your page, reads a few captions, and sends a DM asking about coaching. That lead is warm, specific, and often more commercially valuable than cold traffic because the interest has been created by your content rather than bought with ads.",[615],{"_252":164,"_260":616}," For many UK fitness coaches, Instagram is the top-of-funnel channel that already works. A prospect watches a Reel, clicks through to your page, reads a few captions, and sends a DM asking about coaching. That lead is warm, specific, and often more commercially valuable than cold traffic because the interest has been created by your content rather than bought with ads. ","Why response speed is a revenue issue, not a manners issue","bg-circuit","parallax-section","compact-section","section.section.bg-lines.animate",[280,647,282,619,620],{"_277":228,"_164":646},[625,626,627],{"_252":243,"_162":228,"_277":228,"_164":646,"_238":363},{"_252":253,"_162":224,"_164":642,"_256":643,"_238":367},{"_252":326,"_162":222,"_328":170,"_329":628,"_238":629},[630,631,632],"ul.article-keypoints",{"_164":639,"_256":640},{"_164":636,"_256":637},{"_164":633,"_256":634},"Remove friction: qualified prospects should reach a booking link or payment step without unnecessary back-and-forth.",[635],{"_252":164,"_260":633},"Qualify lightly: a short sequence on goals, budget, and start timing stops your inbox becoming unpaid admin.",[638],{"_252":164,"_260":636},"Reply fast: warm leads cool quickly, so automation protects intent until you are ready to step in personally.",[641],{"_252":164,"_260":639},"If Instagram is where most of your warm leads start, then the first operational problem to fix is not content volume but what happens in the minutes after someone sends a DM. The strongest setup is a simple three-step flow: immediate acknowledgement, basic qualification, and direct movement into booking or payment.",[644],{"_252":164,"_260":645}," If Instagram is where most of your warm leads start, then the first operational problem to fix is not content volume but what happens in the minutes after someone sends a DM. The strongest setup is a simple three-step flow: immediate acknowledgement, basic qualification, and direct movement into booking or payment. ","The short version","bg-lines","section.hero.title-band",[118,660],{"_277":230,"_164":33},[652,653],{"_252":657,"_162":232,"_658":116,"_238":659},{"_252":253,"_162":230,"_164":654,"_256":655,"_238":367},"A practical guide to convert Instagram DMs to clients with faster replies, lightweight qualification, and a clean handoff to booking or payment.",[656],{"_252":164,"_260":654},"image","assetId","img.hero-fallback-image","title-band",{"_162":232,"_277":230,"_164":33},{"_162":230,"_277":228,"_164":646},{"_162":228,"_277":228,"_164":617},{"_162":224,"_277":228,"_164":601},{"_162":222,"_277":228,"_164":562},{"_162":220,"_277":228,"_164":526},{"_162":218,"_277":228,"_164":476},{"_162":214,"_277":228,"_164":431},{"_162":210,"_277":228,"_164":392},{"_162":208,"_277":228,"_164":362},{"_162":204,"_277":228,"_164":278},{"_162":232,"_674":695,"_676":696,"_678":697},{"_162":230,"_674":675,"_676":677,"_678":679},"types",[78,690],"rawJson","{\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://silverstone-ai.com/blog/dm-to-client-automation-uk-fitness-coaches-2026#breadcrumb\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://silverstone-ai.com\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"positio